; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐3‐11
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_23_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:把画室都收拾好以后，艾玛带着我，<br>沿着一楼的过道走向中庭。|#0203Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我们两个走在过道上的时候。|#0203Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！|#0203Adv11_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:传来蕾雅的悲鸣。<br>听起来应该是从中庭传来的。|#0203Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这，不可能……为什么，会这样……<br>啊啊啊啊啊啊！呜啊啊啊啊啊啊！|#0203Adv11_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 廊下を走る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_58 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:过了一会，<br>蕾雅跌跌撞撞地冲进过道，向这边跑来。|#0203Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到我跟艾玛后，<br>她向我们投来了求助的目光。|#0203Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……艾玛……！！|#0203Adv11_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅……|#0203Adv11_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我跟艾玛都没有说话。<br>我们心里都清楚蕾雅看到了什么。|#0203Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:我好像听到下雨了，<br>开始担心布景会不会出问题……|#0203Adv11_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是到中庭看了看……<br>跟我想的一样，布景上的颜料都被雨水打湿，糊成一团……|#0203Adv11_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艰难地挤出这几句话后，<br>蕾雅摇了摇头。|#0203Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:不对，我想说的不是这种事……！|#0203Adv11_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一反平常从容不迫的举止，<br>她显得非常慌乱。|#0203Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安她……死了。|#0203Adv11_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅的语气异常沉重，<br>仿佛不愿意承认刚才自己见到的现实。|#0203Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我知道。|#0203Adv11_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……欸？<br>希罗，这是怎么……|#0203Adv11_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时候，手机响起了通知音。|#0203Adv11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不用看就知道。<br>那一定是典狱长召集所有少女的信息。<br>|#0203Adv11_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

